### Structured Logging

```typescript
function log(level: "info" | "warn" | "error", message: string, data?: Record<string, unknown>) {
  console.log(JSON.stringify({
    level,
    message,
    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
    ...data,
  }));
}

// Usage
